# slopstop working state — gitignored ON PURPOSE.
#
# .slopstop/  per-ticket tracking notes (task_plan/findings/progress), created
#             by :start and moved to .slopstop/ticket-archive/ at :merge.
# scratch/    transient run artifacts from :design / :run (PRDs, charters, run
#             state). Created on demand; never committed.
#
# Both hold machine state, not source. They stay out of the repo and the diff.
# The durable counterpart, design/, IS committed — see HOW-IT-WORKS.md.
.slopstop/
scratch/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Go
/go/wordfreq
